<title>USA: Reuters 12th ex-Miami Air Cargo Market Report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 12th ex-Miami Air Cargo Market Report.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current airfreight rates from Miami International Airport to key destinations in Latin America and Europe.</p>
<p>			May 27	   April 15</p>
<p>			     BRAZIL</p>
<p>    MIA-SAO	 2.05		2.03</p>
<p>			    COLOMBIA</p>
<p>    MIA-BOG	 0.65		0.65</p>
<p>			   ARGENTINA</p>
<p>    MIA-BUE	 1.89		1.93</p>
<p>			    CHILE</p>
<p>    MIA-SCL	 1.79		1.85</p>
<p>			    EUROPE</p>
<p>    MIA-LHR	 1.10		1.15</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, forwarders and smaller air cargo agents.</p>
<p>*All prices quoted in U.S. Dollars.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market actvity.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
